The comment ownership ordering follows upstream develop 72d3b398c420f01f1351b1fc9ddb8fc53eb7faf4;
copy the terminator explicitly instead of relying on strncpy plus zero fill.
Memory streams retain the 4.2.x 32-bit ABI, validate growth before narrowing,
and copy only the destination capacity when reopening with a smaller buffer.

